  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Power is given as,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>Vi</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/8_solu_cet.jpg\" style=\"width: 206px; height: 100px;\" /></p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>50</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfenced></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>10</mn></msqrt><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msqrt><mn>250</mn></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br /><br />and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math> are in series.<br /><br />So, the required resistance&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></mrow></mfenced></msub></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>250</mn></msqrt><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math><br /><br />The heat generated per&nbsp;second in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#937;</mi></math>&nbsp;is given by,<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>Vi</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>&#215;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>250</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>250</mn><mn>100</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>25</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p>",
